<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Incitec half year net profit steady.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Incitec half year net profit steady.</headline>
<dateline>BRISBANE 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months ended March 31</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			    25.52 vs 25.46</p>
<p>    Dividend (cents)		     10.0 vs 15.5</p>
<p>NOTE: Incitec Ltd is a fertiliser and chemical manufacturer and is 69.66 percent owned by ICI Australia Ltd. The company also announced a special dividend of 25 cents per share.</p>
</text>
